# Project Structure

pnpm workspace monorepo with a Next.js App Router app and shared backend packages.

## Root

- `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, `turbo.json`, `package.json` — workspace and build orchestration
- `tsconfig.json`, `tooling/typescript/*.json` — TypeScript bases
- `biome.json` — lint and format (Biome, not ESLint/Prettier)
- `config/` — shared runtime config and types
- `tooling/` — scripts, Tailwind preset, TypeScript presets
- `prompts/` — brand guide and prompt references

## App (frontend)

`apps/web/` — Next.js App Router application (SSR-first)

- **Pages and routing:** `apps/web/app/**`
  - `app/api/**/route.ts` — API routes (edge/server)
  - `app/layout.tsx`, `app/page.tsx`, `app/global-error.tsx` — global files
- **Feature modules:** `apps/web/modules/**`
  - `modules/ui/` — UI components (shadcn/ui, Radix, Tailwind)
  - `modules/shared/` — cross-domain shared code (keep minimal)
- **Public assets:** `apps/web/public/**`
- **Config:** `apps/web/next.config.ts`, `apps/web/postcss.config.cjs`

Place all browser/UI-only code in `apps/web`. Prefer Server Components; limit `use client` to interactive UI concerns.

## Backend and Shared Packages

| Package | Purpose | Status |
|---------|---------|--------|
| `packages/api/` | HonoJS API server — routes, middleware, shared utils | Active (`health`, `auth` routes) |
| `packages/auth/` | better-auth config, helpers, plugins | Active |
| `packages/database/` | Prisma schema, migrations, client | Active |
| `packages/integrations/` | Third-party integrations | Scaffolded |
| `packages/logs/` | Logging config and helper | Active |
| `packages/mail/` | Email providers and templates | Scaffolded |
| `packages/storage/` | File storage providers | Scaffolded |
| `packages/tasks/` | Background tasks / Trigger.dev | Scaffolded |
| `packages/utils/` | Shared utilities (dates, html, links, errors, types) | Active |

### Key Paths

- API entry: `packages/api/src/app.ts`
- API routes: `packages/api/src/routes/**`
- Database schema: `packages/database/prisma/schema.prisma`
- Migrations: `packages/database/prisma/migrations/**`

## Conventions

- Frontend-only code → `apps/web`
- API routes/endpoints → `packages/api/src/routes/**`
- Database schema/migrations → `packages/database/prisma/**`
- Shared utilities/types → `packages/utils/**`
- UI components (design system) → `apps/web/modules/ui/`
- Emails → `packages/mail/`

## Adding New Code

- **UI/feature work:** create components and modules under `apps/web/modules/**` and routes under `apps/web/app/**`
- **Server endpoints:** add Hono routes under `packages/api/src/routes/**` and wire in `src/app.ts`
- **Data model changes:** update `packages/database/prisma/schema.prisma`, create migrations, update affected services
- **Shared logic:** prefer `packages/utils/**` for reusable helpers; avoid duplication in `apps/web`
- **New domain package:** create under `packages/[domain]/` following the existing package structure

Keep TypeScript strict, prefer functional patterns, and follow naming/style conventions.
